OL,3,GNEWSATeacher misses sentencing for
OL,4,Aindecent assault on pupils
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has issued a warrant for the
OL,7,Farrest of a teacher convicted of
OL,8,Fsexually abusing two pupils at an
OL,9,Fall-boys school in the late 1980s after
OL,10,Fshe failed to turn up for her
OL,11,Fsentencing hearing.
OL,13,FSally-Anne Bowen was in her 20s when
OL,14,Fshe had sex with one pupil up to 30
OL,15,Ftimes and kissed a second boy while the
OL,16,Fpupils were aged about 14 or 15.
OL,18,FHer trial heard the chemistry teacher
OL,19,Fwore short tight skirts and flirted in
OL,20,Fclass, with one former pupil comparing
OL,21,Fher behaviour to "a Sabrina Carpenter
OL,22,Fvideo".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
